@startuml
title State Machine for Healthcare Portal

[*] --> Registering : entry / nil
Registering : do / registration process
Registering : exit / valid registration / login

Registering --> LoggingIn : user registers
LoggingIn : entry / login
LoggingIn : do / authentication
LoggingIn : exit / access granted / access denied

LoggingIn --> AccessingFacilities : access granted
AccessingFacilities : entry / login
AccessingFacilities : do / check facilities availability
AccessingFacilities : exit / display available facilities

AccessingFacilities --> ReadingContent : user selects facility
ReadingContent : entry / login
ReadingContent : do / read content
ReadingContent : exit / continue using system / finish session

ReadingContent --> CheckingSymptoms : user reads content
CheckingSymptoms : entry / login
CheckingSymptoms : do / check symptoms or use fitness options
CheckingSymptoms : exit / continue using system / finish session

CheckingSymptoms --> ProcessingInsurance : user selects service
ProcessingInsurance : entry / login
ProcessingInsurance : do / process and validate insurance
ProcessingInsurance : exit / payment processing

ProcessingInsurance --> PayingWithInsurance : payment processing successful
PayingWithInsurance : entry / login
PayingWithInsurance : do / complete payment with insurance
PayingWithInsurance : exit / payment completed

ProcessingInsurance --> PayingWithCash : payment processing unsuccessful
PayingWithCash : entry / login
PayingWithCash : do / select cash as payment method
PayingWithCash : exit / display cash details

PayingWithCash --> CompletingPayment : user selects cash
CompletingPayment : entry / login
CompleletingPayment : do / complete payment with cash
CompletingPayment : exit / payment completed

ProcessingInsurance --> [*] : payment processing failed

LoggingIn --> [*] : access denied

ReadingContent --> [*] : finish session

CheckingSymptoms --> [*] : finish session

PayingWithCash --> [*] : finish session

PayingWithInsurance --> [*] : finish session

CompletingPayment --> [*] : finish session
@enduml
